        where ``divisor`` is a tensor that depends only on the shape
        and dtype of the ``input``:

        >>> # xdoctest: +SKIP
        >>> input_ones = torch.ones(input.shape, dtype=input.dtype)
        >>> divisor = fold(unfold(input_ones))

